# Allowlist for scripts/check-action-literals.sh — one path (or directory
# prefix) per line, whole file exempt. Every entry is a FOLLOW-UP: these
# files still define their own copy of the action list and must be switched
# to `import … from '../vocab/actions'` as soon as their owner can take the
# edit. Remove the line in the same commit.
#
# Owned by the Phase 5 (per-party contract identity) branch at the time of
# the Phase 6.5 commit — not edited here to keep that merge clean:
#   TRANSPORT_ACTIONS / MESSAGE_ACTIONS (contractAuth.js:297,300) → TRANSPORT_ACTIONS, MESSAGE_ACTIONS
#   TRANSPORT_ACTIONS + capabilities/intentOps advert (a2a.ts:627,717,719) → TRANSPORT_ACTIONS, INTENT_OPS, A2A_METHODS
#   ALWAYS_ALLOWED_ACTIONS (intentExecutor.ts:42) → TRANSPORT_ACTIONS minus tasks_*
#   VALID_OPS (intentToken.ts:118) → INTENT_OPS
#   NON_CACHEABLE_OPS (intentCache.ts:39) → ACTION.discover
server/utils/contractAuth.js
server/routes/a2a.ts
server/protocols/
# Demo seed data run by plain node (no TS loader); the contract rows it
# writes are data, not a vocabulary definition. Switch to the vocabulary
# when the demo scripts move to tsx.
demo/scripts/provision-domains.js
